{"title":"냥냥타불상궁투 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=HkFVu/dJMcacdaNzk/oC4N4VSkF0pgONkPgk2vh0&filename=th3","synopsis":"입궁 전날, 언니가 말했다.\n황궁은 사람이 사람을 잡아먹는 곳이라고.\n\n강만의 계획은 단순했다.\n궁에 들어가 조용히 산다.\n암투에 끼어들지 않는다.\n아무도 그녀를 기억하지 않도록.\n세 번의 봄이 지나도 계획은 순조로웠다.\n\n네 번째 봄날, 옥부원에 황제가 나타났다.\n\n봄이 지나고-\n강만은 자신의 배가 불러오고 있다는 것을 알아챘다.\n도망치고 싶었다.\n하지만 이미 늦었다.\n배 속의 아이가 증거였고, 황제는 이미 알고 있었다.\n\n\"도망칠 수 있을 것 같나.\"","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":159,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":93,"change":{"type":"up","amount":66}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":162,"change":{"type":"down","amount":69}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":214,"change":{"type":"down","amount":52}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":183,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":270,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":188,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":159,"change":{"type":"up","amount":29}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":139,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":137,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":131,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":128,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":155,"change":{"type":"down","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":219,"change":{"type":"down","amount":64}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":258,"change":{"type":"down","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":292,"change":{"type":"down","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":287,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":259,"change":{"type":"up","amount":28}}],"monthly":[{"date":"2026-09-25","rank":299,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-26","rank":295,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}}]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-07","v":3750,"rc":2,"rs":20,"cc":1}]}